wildos-portal (0.1.4) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The Open dialog can show Large icons with a preview of each picture,
    as on Windows, through the switch beside New folder. Choosing a photo
    opens in Large icons, other files in Details, and the dialog keeps the
    view you pick for that kind of file.

 -- Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>  Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:26:46 +0000

wildos-portal (0.1.3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The Open and Save dialog is attached to the window that opened it, as
    on Windows: it has no taskbar button of its own, stays in front of
    that window, and the window waits until the dialog closes.

 -- Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>  Fri, 13 Nov 2026 20:41:57 +0000

wildos-portal (0.1.2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The Open and Save dialog starts where you last opened or saved that
    kind of file in that app, or in any app, as Windows does. A picture
    picker starts in Pictures the first time, videos in Videos and music
    in Music.

